        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King's Subsidy is a turn-based economic strategy game with rogue-lite mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan. Develop. Extract. Trade. Protect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/d5a196c7daabaf29fd4b9cf6d8a78866.avif?t=1762278499\" width=1560 height=968 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 60 crafting recipes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex crafting tree. Plan your strategy to make the most of the opportunities the game offers. Will you forge tools and weapons, or perhaps mint your own gold coins? You decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/ce348f451ab90829950dd280f3c74b98.avif?t=1762278499\" width=1054 height=1104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on a variety of challenging missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face objectives from many different missions, which will influence your character’s skills. Discover the trades of the most famous merchants. Special rewards await the most persistent players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/b920d61058fd981cb319a928401aa1fd.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=628 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 mines to discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely which materials to gather and which to buy. What could be better than discovering a coal mine when your economy is focused on blacksmithing when steel prices are rising?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/56f8bf140e109849aec7424cc4a61be3.poster.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/56f8bf140e109849aec7424cc4a61be3.webm?t=1762278499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/56f8bf140e109849aec7424cc4a61be3.mp4?t=1762278499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a city</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the king grow the economy. Complete mission objectives and pay your taxes on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/7d5ec086367c497c91a0b339afa96068.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe cooperating with the king isn't the only profitable path...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll encounter events that bring great benefits—or major losses. Will the risk be worth it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/7e12a768fdb95c66640d5d0a856f7352.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 different characters to choose from.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the unique skills of the world’s most influential merchants and develop their potential. Each run lets you pick a different set of abilities and approach the game in a new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/06336d668c96bd8c20b344627b5830e2.poster.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/06336d668c96bd8c20b344627b5830e2.webm?t=1762278499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/06336d668c96bd8c20b344627b5830e2.mp4?t=1762278499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your research to fit your strategy. You decide what, where, and when to trade. Unlock advanced upgrades by completing the game on higher difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/231d9ff4617515d97da1bff6c3161677.avif?t=1762278499\" width=1408 height=962 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King's Subsidy is a turn-based economic strategy game with rogue-lite mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan. Develop. Extract. Trade. Protect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/d5a196c7daabaf29fd4b9cf6d8a78866.avif?t=1762278499\" width=1560 height=968 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 60 crafting recipes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex crafting tree. Plan your strategy to make the most of the opportunities the game offers. Will you forge tools and weapons, or perhaps mint your own gold coins? You decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/ce348f451ab90829950dd280f3c74b98.avif?t=1762278499\" width=1054 height=1104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on a variety of challenging missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face objectives from many different missions, which will influence your character’s skills. Discover the trades of the most famous merchants. Special rewards await the most persistent players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/b920d61058fd981cb319a928401aa1fd.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=628 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 mines to discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely which materials to gather and which to buy. What could be better than discovering a coal mine when your economy is focused on blacksmithing when steel prices are rising?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/56f8bf140e109849aec7424cc4a61be3.poster.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/56f8bf140e109849aec7424cc4a61be3.webm?t=1762278499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/56f8bf140e109849aec7424cc4a61be3.mp4?t=1762278499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a city</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the king grow the economy. Complete mission objectives and pay your taxes on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/7d5ec086367c497c91a0b339afa96068.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe cooperating with the king isn't the only profitable path...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll encounter events that bring great benefits—or major losses. Will the risk be worth it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/7e12a768fdb95c66640d5d0a856f7352.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 different characters to choose from.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the unique skills of the world’s most influential merchants and develop their potential. Each run lets you pick a different set of abilities and approach the game in a new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/06336d668c96bd8c20b344627b5830e2.poster.avif?t=1762278499\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/06336d668c96bd8c20b344627b5830e2.webm?t=1762278499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/06336d668c96bd8c20b344627b5830e2.mp4?t=1762278499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your research to fit your strategy. You decide what, where, and when to trade. Unlock advanced upgrades by completing the game on higher difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999180/extras/231d9ff4617515d97da1bff6c3161677.avif?t=1762278499\" width=1408 height=962 /></span></p>",
